--- !u!114 &914846256
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 914846254}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 92b5b6357c7c0ab44a023db23ae9dabb, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  dialogue:
    name: Spyglass
    nameExtra:
    - 
    - 
    - 
    - 
    - 
    - 
    - 
    - Narrator
    - 
    - 
    - Spyglass
    - Narrator
    - Spyglass
    - 
    - Narrator
    - Spyglass
    - 
    - Narrator
    - Spyglass
    - Narrator
    - 
    - 
    - 
    - Spyglass
    - Narrator
    - Spyglass
    - 
    - Narrator
    sentences:
    - 'I woke up alone, cold, dirty, on the wrong side of the gallows. A small little
      creature, just trying to live their life. '
    - I reached out to the cold world only to have my hand slapped away. But I had
      a purpose, and I was going to see it through to the end.
    - "\u2026only problem was, I needed to find out what that purpose was."
    - "I may have, er, overembellished my current situation a little, because I was
      nowhere near the side of the road, so to speak. I wasn\u2019t even outside"
    - No - I was inside of some kind of crazy contraption of astronomical heights.
    - The grey lights everywhere, shining in my face and almost blinding me, and
      oh the horrible, horrible noise.
    - It was enough to make a humble little jerboa such as myself run and hide in
      a corner.
    - 'It was the bottom of the barrell, and while I may have been scraping it, I
      am no coward.

'
    - "The little pest speaks with so much conviction you\u2019d have thought they
      knew what they were doing! Hahaha!"
    - "But maybe they can prove it; coming into my casino, there\u2019s only one
      way to get the big cheese - win, and win big!"
    - Those ugly, bulging eyes of theirs might even help them out here, HA!
    - I turned to the source of the voice, to no avail - nobody was there, but I
      knew someone was speaking.
    - "\u2026what the-"
    - "Hey! I\u2019m trying to think here! And I don\u2019t appreciate the unnecessary
      comments about my appearance! "
    - You make me sound unflattering.
    - "Oh, I don\u2019t need to make you SOUND like anything."
    - '*groan*'
    - "Look, I\u2019m a professional. The real deal. If you don\u2019t want to end
      up on the wrong side of the stage when I\u2019m only trying to help\u2013"
    - "Bah! A professional they say! Priceless! Tell me, rodent, if you\u2019re a
      professional, then what are you a professional of?"
    - "I-...well, you see, I\u2019m-...well that isn't..!"
    - "CAN\u2019T EVEN COME UP WITH SOMETHING AS SIMPLE AS THAT, BAHAHA!"
    - "I\u2019ll tell you what. \r\n"
    - "I\u2019m sure that if you win all of these games here and score as high as
      you can, you might just remember what your little job is."
    - "How\u2019s that sound?"
    - "Fine. My new purpose is to\u2026find my purpose. Fair enough.\r"
    - "Fantastic.\r"
    - "What the ugly sounding voice in my head doesn\u2019t realize is that I\u2019m
      playing him like a fiddle. \r"
    - "I\u2019ll play his game - but he has to play mine, too. I\u2019ll find my
      purpose. Then, I find him.\r"
    - "What a nutjob.\r"
--- !u!114 &914846257
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 914846254}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 92b5b6357c7c0ab44a023db23ae9dabb, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  dialogue:
    name: Narrator
    nameExtra:
    - 
    - 
    - 
    - 
    - 
    - 
    - Jack
    - 
    - 
    - 
    - Narrator
    - 
    - 
    - Jack
    - 
    - 
    - Narrator
    sentences:
    - "New Andromeda City\u2019s full of all sorts of people. . "
    - "From the big guys running Wall Station, to the little guys always buildin\u2019
      something new and everyone in between, ridin\u2019 on the space tram"
    - But one rabbit always runs unnoticed..
    - Enter Jack, a little nobody tucked away in a run-down alleyway, 25 years and
      counting.
    - "Some folks here like to call him Jumpin\u2019 Jack, on account of his quick
      reflexes..."
    - "and the fact no cop\u2019s managed to catch him red-handed with a fistful
      of some shmuck\u2019s cash."
    - "It\u2019s the only way to survive in a place like this, when you\u2019ve got
      nothing."
    - "Some rich asshole\u2019s getting a crazy tax break with this one, huh?"
    - Why else would anyone throw away an entire fortune?
    - '[cough]'
    - "I bet he has investments tucked away somewhere. I bet he\u2019ll put it down
      as a charitable donation."
    - "That\u2019s some fightin\u2019 words, Jackass! Mind your business when it
      comes to mine!"
    - "But if you\u2019re somebody in the know, you might hear a different name for
      this lanky lad.\r\n"
    - Jack-of-all trades, a master of none- but more skilled than a master of one.
    - 'All these guys are the exact same. But who cares.. So long as I can get a
      piece of that pie.

'
    - "I\u2019ve got nothing to lose-"
    - "After all, I\u2019ll win. I\u2019ll swipe it all right under their noses."
    - "Well, let\u2019s see about all that.."
