--- !u!114 &914846260
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 914846254}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 92b5b6357c7c0ab44a023db23ae9dabb, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  dialogue:
    name: Narrator
    nameExtra:
    - 
    - 
    - Bullseye
    - Narrator
    - Merc 1
    - Merc 2
    - Bullseye
    - 
    - Merc 3
    - Merc 1
    - Merc 2
    - Merc 3
    - Bullseye
    - Merc 3
    - 
    - 
    - 
    - 
    - Narrator
    - 
    - 
    - 
    - Bullseye
    - 
    - 
    - 
    sentences:
    - 'Here we have a group of ragtag mercenaries, bunched up in the center of an
      Astral Bar, smack dab in the center of the galaxy. '
    - "Ha, any one of these gremlins could\u2019ve made an attempt at my life. Wouldn\u2019t
      be the first!"
    - "But if there\u2019s one thing I know about these mercenary types, it\u2019s
      that they, just like anyone else\u2026"
    - "Hey boys\u2019 en girls, look at that! Gleebnar of all people is giving up
      his fortune!"
    - "\u2026can\u2019t resist the call of money!"
    - "No way it isn\u2019t a scam though\u2026"
    - "Yea, boss! You can never trust these kinds o\u2019 quick talking, money grubbin\u2019
      businessgoiys! Look where the last one left us."
    - "Oof, you\u2019re right. With work getting more and more automated, it\u2019s
      tough for our little band to keep goin\u2019 like this\u2026 "
    - "Treasury, how\u2019s our lined up jobs looking?"
    - "Bad News. Our current jobs ain\u2019t enough to recoup these losses."
    - WHAT!?
    - YOU SERIOUS DOC!?
    - "I wouldn\u2019t be in charge of this if I weren\u2019t, though."
    - Treasurer, couldja explain?
    - Sure.
    - "Long story short, between that wise guy running off with the majority of our
      savings, and the amount of booze we\u2019ve collectively downed\u2026"
    - ...rising transportation costs...
    - "and the amount of booze we\u2019ve collectively downed\u2026"
    - "We\u2019d need a miracle to get us outta this."
    - A miracle worker, huh? I like that.
    - "Catchy, rolls off the tongue and makes me sound real good. Which means it\u2019ll
      be even easier to advertise!"
    - Imagine the riches piling up when they give money to the miracle worker that
      saved their asses from debt!
    - "I\u2019ve got my eye on you, so you better not disappoint."
    - Then daresay, I better try my luck with what I got left!
    - We got big dreams, the lot of us..
    - " We still need a base, a ship with better rocket thrusters, money for ya sister\u2019s
      treatment, money for my nephews and nieces\u2019 education\u2026"
    - "We can\u2019t give up now!"
