--- !u!114 &914846264
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 914846254}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 92b5b6357c7c0ab44a023db23ae9dabb, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  dialogue:
    name: Narrator
    nameExtra:
    - 
    - 
    - 
    - 
    - 
    - Madame Fortune
    - 
    - 
    - 
    - 
    - 
    - Lucky
    - Madame Fortune
    - Narrator
    - 
    - 
    - Madame Fortune
    - Narrator
    sentences:
    - Amidst all the turmoil of the Underbelly- The criminals, the addicts, the failed
      business majors...
    - 'the poors... '
    - One star manages to shine brilliantly in darkness.
    - The Marvelous Madame Fortune puts on yet another fantastical show at a local
      speak-easy, capturing the hearts of men and women alike.
    - "Once part of the Circus, she has graduated to performing at the local venues.
      \r\n"
    - 'Her beauty and unabashedly earnest expression comes with many misunderstandings,
      though..

'
    - "Ah\u2026 a dance? I apologize, Monsieur, but at the moment I only ask audience
      members to sing or clap along. "
    - "There isn\u2019t enough space to dance on stage with me or the musicians..."
    - What..? NO! Get your mind out of the gutter! Absolutely not!
    - "Oh Lucky, what do I do? I thought others would finally take me seriously once
      I left the Circus!\r"
    - "I want to have fun, and inspire others to have fun with my performances..
      But everyone takes it the wrong way, or thinks I\u2019m trying to lead them
      on.. "
    - But if the wrong person throws a fit, I might get kicked to the gutters! And
      then- and then how am I going to support our family-
    - "It\u2019s not your fault, my dear Fortune. Some people really can\u2019t get
      their heads outta the gutter. The kids always get so excited about what you\u2019re
      gonna sing next..\r\n\r"
    - "HUH? The Lucky 7 Casino?! Hey, wait a second\u2026 could this be.."
    - It sure is, kitty! I hear those gears turning...
    - "Could this be your big break to rise above it all? It wouldn\u2019t be the
      first time, either.."
    - "The Madame is dashing, quick, and plenty clever too- Don\u2019tcha love a
      good game of chance? All you\u2019d have to do is pounce on the opportunity!
      Whaddya say?"
    - "My luck\u2019s better than anybody\u2019s! If I was able to outplay the Ringleader
      all those years ago, I think I can do the same here!\r\n"
    - "Attagirl! Careful not to lose it all, now! Wouldn\u2019t wanna see a talent
      like yours fall from stardom..\r\n"
