--- !u!114 &914846266
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 914846254}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 92b5b6357c7c0ab44a023db23ae9dabb, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  dialogue:
    name: Narrator
    nameExtra:
    - 
    - 
    - Strangula
    - Narrator
    - Strangula
    - 
    - 
    - 
    - 
    - Narrator
    - Strangula
    - 
    - Narrator
    - Strangula
    - 
    - 
    - 
    sentences:
    - "We open up on some random, in the middle of an island in who knows where in
      I don\u2019t even know what corner of the galaxy."
    - "Seriously, who is this? Is she even from our galaxy? \r"
    - "Bah, doesn\u2019t matter, I don\u2019t need to know her circumstances. That\u2019s
      WAY more boring than who she really is!\r\n"
    - "Ooooohkay! Perfect picture of my saltwater ambrosia salad, it\u2019s gonna
      wow the club.. Kiiiiids, c\u2019mere! \r\n"
    - "Here you see, a woman with a family that loves her dearly, posting images
      of her food on her socials, all so she can chase her one true love\u2026"
    - 'Okie dokie now, everyone give me a biiiig smile next to the yummy dessert- '
    - Okay Kelsea? Kelsea? Cut the attitude, I need you to ACTUALLY smile, put your
      teeth in it. There you go darling.
    - "Go off now, let Mommy check her phone.. Teehee, now \u2026 post!"
    - "This\u2019ll do BIG NUMBERS on FaceTok\u2026 and we\u2019ll see if me or that
      BITCH Karen from golfing has more followers. \r\n"
    - "If it gets over 200k shares, it\u2019ll be enough for me to take a little
      trip down to Margaritaville\u2026 And the slots! ^_^"
    - "GAMBLING! MAKING MONEY! WINNING BIG! Hahaha, now THAT\u2019S what I like to
      see!\r\n"
    - Hmm?
    - No fucking way. Is this for real?
    - As real as a real can get! Absolutely, undeniably, positively real! Realer
      than the reels you post on those socials real! And I know a gambler in need
      when I see it!
    - "HONEY!! I want to take a trip to Gleebnar\u2019s Casino! We can bring the
      kids to your mom\u2019s summer house-"
    - "WHAT? Oh c\u2019moooon, it won\u2019t matter when you get your big bad salary
      bonus next month."
    - "The kids?? They\u2019ll be playing the Gameboy 2 or whatever it\u2019s called
      now. They\u2019ll sit quietly in the corner."
    - "Sweeties! Daddy\u2019s gonna take us on a trip! And Mommy\u2019s gonna win
      BIG! \r\n"
