--- !u!114 &914846268
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 914846254}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 92b5b6357c7c0ab44a023db23ae9dabb, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  dialogue:
    name: Narrator
    nameExtra:
    - 
    - 
    - 
    - 
    - 
    - 
    - 
    - Alan Slugger
    - 
    - 
    - 
    sentences:
    - Oh ho ho, now what do we have here?
    - "I bet none of the schmucks out there have any idea who they\u2019re tangling
      with."
    - "I\u2019ve been doin\u2019 this gig for a real long time, see. Coast to coast,
      planet to planet, star to star, expanding the casino the likes of which you\u2019d
      never expect."
    - And here, right here, at this section of the galaxy, is where all the action
      happens!
    - "You meet all kinds of people in the southernmost hemisphere, see. You\u2019ll
      meet the nutjobs, the whackadoodles, the clowns, the freakshows! "
    - "But, ah, the most important of all of them are the criminals. All kinds of
      em! All people that are just \u201Ctrying to survive\u201D."
    - "But this one is special. The head hancho! The leader of \u2018em all, heading
      that multi-planet criminal conglomerate he calls a mafia!\r"
    - "Good \u2018ole Alan Sluggard!\r"
    - "So, good \u2018ole Tommy finally decided to hang up and call it quits, eh?
      Got tired of the little casino schtick he had goin\u2019 on?\r"
    - "You know, that casino of his has been a real lucrative investment. Would be
      a shame to lose out on it all, wouldn\u2019t it?\r"
    - "Oh, this is very, very good news. Tell your boys to go pack their things.
      Send a message to everyone. The family is going on a little\u2026.vacation,
      eh?\r\r"
    - "Now, then. Looks like I\u2019m going to pay a visit to an old friend of mine."
--- !u!114 &914846269
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 914846254}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 92b5b6357c7c0ab44a023db23ae9dabb, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  dialogue:
    name: Narrator
    nameExtra:
    - 
    - 
    - Larry
    - 
    - 
    - 
    - Narrator
    - 
    - Larry
    - 
    - 
    - 
    - Narrator
    - Larry
    - 
    - Narrator
    - Larry
    - Narrator
    sentences:
    - "In the glittering corporate castles of the Galaxy\u2019s finest, one old dog
      continually fails to learn new tricks."
    - "An utterly unevolved, uninteresting corporate wageslave finds himself listless
      on his lunch, scrolling through the same ole\u2019 wasteland of thoughtless
      slop."
    - Can chance uplift him out of his capitalistic hellscape? Or will he continue
      to disappoint? Gahaha!
    - Finally have a couple minutes to get a damn break.
    - ...
    - Oh goddamnit that-...
    - THAT SON OF A BITCH!
    - "Hey, asshole! Don\u2019t you disrespect my muddah! Yours on the other hand-
      Who the hell names their kid Larry?!"
    - No wonder your little business pitch fell flat on its face- Do you even bother
      with anything other than mindless number crunches and kissing ass on the clock?
    - ...
    - '*clears throat*'
    - "Sorry, sorry, no, everything is okay, I just\u2013..no, it\u2019s just some
      personal drama, don\u2019t even worry about it. Seriously, don\u2019t worry
      about it. It\u2019s nothing."
    - "Uh, yes, sir, I\u2019ll be back to work in a few minutes."
    - Clearly not.
    - "\u2026all that time buttering up the guy and he won't even throw me a bone.
      But he\u2019ll throw away his whole FORTUNE!? "
    - "Why I oughta show him a thing or two, I swear I\u2019ll\u2026\r"
    - "Y\u2019know Larry-boy? Why not give it a shot? I mean seriously, what else
      does a washed up business guy like yourself got going on?\r\n"
    - "Yeah. That\u2019s it. I\u2019ll win. That\u2019ll teach him!\r"
    - "Let\u2019s see you try, big boss!\r"
